                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Deployment Phase</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **^^Ogor Infantry^^** unit on the battlefield to be the target.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the battle, ignore negative modifiers to hit rolls and wound rolls for the target&apos;s combat attacks while they are wholly within 12&quot; of and visible to this unit.</characteristic>
