              </attributes>
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Enemy Charge Phase</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **^^Ogor Infantry^^** unit that is not in combat to be the target.</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 3+, the target can move a number of inches equal to the roll. It can move through the combat ranges of enemy units and can end that move in combat. If it ended that move in combat, the target has charged.</characteristic>
