          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry name="Megagobbler" id="bb4d-b531-0cf7-42cc" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="815b-fcf3-c5f5-39bd" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="roster" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Megagobbler" id="b7cc-3da7-c9d8-2b63" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)">
                  <attributes>
                    <attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Black</attribute>
                    <attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute>
                    <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa"/>
                  </attributes>
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle, Deployment Phase</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick 1 of the following keywords:
• **^^Infantry^^**
• **^^Cavalry^^**
• **^^Monster^^**
• **^^War Machine^^**
• **^^Beast^^**
For the rest of the battle, each time any damage points are allocated to an enemy unit with that keyword by this unit&apos;s combat attacks and that enemy unit is destroyed in the same turn, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of this unit&apos;s melee weapons. This effect is cumulative.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
                    <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Mage-Swallower" id="7f03-729f-7292-eaae" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
